# Trade Alert API — REST Client requests
# Requires: humao.rest-client
# Set active environment: Ctrl+Shift+P → "Rest Client: Switch Environment" → local

@baseUrl = {{$dotenv DASHBOARD_BASE_URL}}
@apiKey  = {{$dotenv DASHBOARD_API_KEY}}

### Health check (unauthenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Auth probe (validates API key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/test
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Prometheus metrics (unauthenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### Dashboard summary KPIs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/summary
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Winrate by edge-probability bucket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/winrate
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Alert frequency — last 30 days (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/frequency?days=30
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Alert frequency — last 7 days
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/frequency?days=7
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Symbol performance — top 20 (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/symbols?limit=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Symbol performance — top 50
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/symbols?limit=50
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Recent alerts — last 50 (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?limit=50
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Recent alerts — last 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?limit=200
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
